    "created_at": "2020-01-03T14:30:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-03T14:30:43Z",
    "body": "Yeah, the parallel with `class` is the only thing I’ve been able to surface or think of, and a few times I’ve introduced invisible empty elements for the purpose of multiple anchors in the same place; allowing a set of IDs *would* be nice. But in practice, browsers all treat the space as part of the ID, so I suppose that ship has long sailed.",
